      {
        "op": "setProgramDescription",
        "text": "S01 Magnet_Feed - feeds magnets one at a time from an indexed stack to the pick station. Hold down clamps the stack, vertical shuttle raises it, horizontal shuttle presents the top magnet coin-changer style. Top retainer extends before every horizontal shuttle move and retracts after shuttle-over so magnets cannot magnetize and flip up. Presentation retries up to 3x on a missing magnet (PresentRetryCount), then unclamps, lowers the shuttle and requests a fresh stack from Dial_Index (p_RequestIndex). Magnet_Pick handshakes: p_MagnetReady out; Magnet_Taken / Magnet_Lost / Request_New_Magnet / Pick_Gave_Up in (engineer placeholders, see *Replace comments in R02)."
      }
